    "text": {
     "en": "Observation means looking carefully using our senses. We can also use tools such as a magnifying glass, a ruler and a thermometer.\nA scientist records observations in a notebook with dates, drawings and measurements so that others can check them.\nCuriosity means asking questions. Asking 'why' and 'how' leads to discoveries, and every answer can start a new question."
    }
